    "text": "In the figure <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is the vertical tower and <math><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi></math> are the two points<br />Now, in right angled <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0002_3c6f077377b4.png\" style=\"width:2.36667in;height:1.88681in\" /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />In right angled <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;meters"
